### TOKEN REQUEST
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic bXV0eWEtYnJva2VyMTpwYXNzMTIz

### REFRESH TOKEN
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{refreshToken}}

### USER DETAILS
GET {{host}}/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### CLIENTS USED BY USER
GET {{host}}/reference/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### REPORTS || SUMMARY REPORT
GET {{host}}/reports/summary?from_date=01/01/2025&to_date=07/08/2025&client_code=479354463000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###  REGISTRATION || CHECK IF USERNAME EXIST
GET {{host}}/utilities/registration/check/username?value=mutya-broker11
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ALL CLIENT
GET {{host}}/reference/clients/all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ALL PROFILE TYPE
GET {{host}}/reference/profile/all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ALL COUNTRY
GET {{host}}/reference/country/all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ALL DEPARTMENT
