GET {{host}}/search/consolidator?value=EMBASSY
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GET WAREHOUSE BY RANGE
GET {{host}}/reference/warehouse/range?start=1&end=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### SEARCH WAREHOUSE
GET {{host}}/search/warehouse?value=TMW
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GET DEPARTMENT BY RANGE
GET {{host}}/reference/department/range?start=1&end=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

