### REPORT | NSL CHECK IF TEMPLATE NAME EXIST
GET {{host}}/search/template/check/name?value=MUTYA
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### REPORT | NSL SAVE TEMPLATE
POST {{host}}/reports/nsl/save/template
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateName": "Monthly Summary",
  "columns": "DEPT;PRO;HAWB",
}
